      "content": "i dont even know why i bother anymore. i've spent 6 months trying to fix this housing error and every single time i call they just pass me to someone else or tell me the form is \"pending\" but it's been pending since august. i feel like im just a number they're waiting to expire. like i dont even exist to them. it’s like the system is just designed to make you disappear.",
